    "behaviour": {"x": 470, "y": 0, "w": 560, "fill": "blue", "size": "m", "text": "Behaviour notes (decisions from the product owner)\n\n1. The code changes every 30 s. The bar counts 30 → 0 and turns orange in the last 5 s. Always visible.\n2. Only the current code is shown. The previous code still works for one more window (30–60 s in total), silently.\n3. Only the ID has a Copy button. The 6-digit code is not copyable on purpose: the reporter must read it in person.\n4. Show large QR opens a full-screen view (QR, ID, code, countdown) for scanning from about 2 m. Close or Esc returns.\n5. If a refresh fails, the last QR and code stay visible, greyed, with \"Reconnecting…\". Error appears only on a failed first load, or once the last code has really expired (about 60 s).\n6. The reporting section is called \"Record a deed\". English only for v1.\n7. Not signed in → login page. Setup not finished → normally redirected to onboarding; the in-page \"Setup not finished\" state is the fallback if the API says onboarding_required.\n\nPress Play on the prototype: the countdown runs, the code changes, and Copy ID, Show large QR and Reset all work."}
